  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 3rd level, a huay may move through any sort of undergrowth (such as natural thorns, briars, overgrown areas, and similar terrain) at their normal speed and without taking damage or suffering any other impairment. Thorns, briars, and overgrown areas that have been magically manipulated to impede motion, however, still affect them. The huay may burn a point of essence in order to ignore magically manipulated terrain for a number of rounds equal to their Wisdom modifier + 3.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/huay#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
